# Delegate naming

Protocol: `<Component>Delegate`. Methods: action verbs only.

```swift
protocol GenreFilterViewDelegate: AnyObject {
    func didSelectGenre(at index: Int)
}
```

Avoid UIKit-style sender prefixes:

```swift
// ❌
func genreFilterView(_ view: GenreFilterView, didSelectGenreAt index: Int)

// ✅
func didSelectGenre(at index: Int)
```

Do not pass the sender as the first parameter. Call with `delegate?.didSelectGenre(at: index)`.

See [view-conventions.md](../../cineteca/view-conventions.md) — Delegates section.
